{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2021-04", "window": 2, "start_date": 1617840000, "end_date": 1618531199, "month_true_total": 47, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:52:49 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "90253745", "author": {"steamid": "76561198140143442", "personaname": "flagrock", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198140143442/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1890, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 160, "last_played": 1765056301, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Mass Effect 3 on Steam is broken. EA forces you to go through the Origin app/launcher to play this game which causes no end of issues with actually getting this game to run. After playing this one time, ME3 fails to launch. Trying to launch via Steam sent an endless loop of failing to open the Origin app. Trying to go through Origin app after connecting my ME3 key from Steam causes ME3 to do an endless loop of failing to launch and going back to the Origin homepage.\n\nJust get this game on console if you really want to play it. ME3 is a good game, but has too many issues on PC running to be worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1618334082, "timestamp_updated": 1618334082, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 52, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.760504662990570068", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "90218610", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083459543", "personaname": "Badyoda1", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198083459543/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7, "last_played": 1599788613, "avatar": "eae9c18e15e28cfa4397b1f08713c1e9701c05c3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game,  can't wait for the legendary edition!", "timestamp_created": 1618276412, "timestamp_updated": 1618276412, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "90164136", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010148534", "personaname": "wolf560", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jaguar560/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 5310, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 431, "last_played": 1621039110, "avatar": "e77ce0b711979898c1536fb95c3184cf398c56ae"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is an awesome franchise that EA completely screwed up at the very end with Andromeda.  So may people hurting from the botched series of ending of ME3, and then to follow up with a wonky Andromeda instead of trying to actually produce a thing of beauty.\n\nMass Effect 1-3 was a Sci-Fi accomplishment that I played for nearly 5 years, and anxiously awaited every little thing they did for the series. It brings back some seriously great memories playing it now with a 21:9 wide screen.", "timestamp_created": 1618190127, "timestamp_updated": 1618190127, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "90157105", "author": {"steamid": "76561198089115328", "personaname": "sexymonkeyninja", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sexymonkeyninja/", "num_games_owned": 730, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 1010, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 510, "last_played": 1621631541, "avatar": "a73955f5d746e6e266b5170c2eed3047928ff0b7"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've only done the multiplayer and you get to level up your dudes and get weapons. You can play this for lots of hours. It's fun. I haven't started the story line but my wife assures me that it is tits.", "timestamp_created": 1618177711, "timestamp_updated": 1618177711, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "90100190", "author": {"steamid": "76561198155177575", "personaname": "Nom Anor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/steppingrazorimo/", "num_games_owned": 494, "num_reviews": 77, "playtime_forever": 15985, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4576, "last_played": 1777163980, "avatar": "859ecbb4a93c8725a01ca7d2ab427ca2b398393b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Epic.", "timestamp_created": 1618102520, "timestamp_updated": 1618102520, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}]}